		description: 'Artikel, gambar berita, dan video bisa diupload tanpa khawatir space habis atau loading lambat.',
		icon: '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-speedometer2 text-yellow-400" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V6a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0V4.5A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4zM3.732 5.732a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0l.915.914a.5.5 0 1 1-.708.708l-.914-.915a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.707zM2 10a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h1.586a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1H2.5A.5.5 0 0 1 2 10zm9.5 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h1.5a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1H12a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zm.794-4.293a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l.914.915a.5.5 0 1 1-.707.707l-.915-.914a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708z"/><path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8zm2.5 0a5.5 5.5 0 1 1 10.917 2.636c-.302-.386-.745-.766-1.28-1.101-.181-.113-.384-.21-.597-.282A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2.5 8z"/></svg>'
	},
	{
		title: 'SEO Optimized',
		description: 'Artikel Anda cepat terindeks Google untuk menjangkau lebih banyak pembaca.',
		icon: '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-search text-yellow-400" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M11.742 10.344a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-1.397 1.398h-.001c.03.04.062.078.098.115l3.85 3.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.415-1.414l-3.85-3.85a1.007 1.007 0 0 0-.115-.1zM12 6.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0z"/></svg>'
