		icon: '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-cash-coin text-yellow-400" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 1a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5H5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1 0 11h6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-11h-.5zM5 2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10a1 1 0 1 0 2 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm6.5 1.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3.236l.707.707a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708l-1-1a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l1-1a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L12 6.236V4.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5zM4.5 7a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2.236l-.707.707a.5.5 0 1 1-.708-.708l1-1a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l-1-1a.5.5 0 1 1 .708.708L4 9.236V7.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5z"/></svg>'
	},
	{
		title: 'Support 24/7 Selamanya',
		description: 'Ada masalah teknis? Hubungi kami via WhatsApp kapan saja, kami siap membantu sampai masalah selesai.',
		icon: '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-headset text-yellow-400" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v1h1a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.732V6a6 6 0 1 1 12 0v.268A2 2 0 0 1 15 8v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V8a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1V6a5 5 0 0 0-5-5z"/><path d="M12.5 12.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 10 15H8a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h2a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5z"/></svg>'
